1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,999
Tokenizing a bond is only the beginning.

2
00:00:02,999 --> 00:00:11,082
LifecycleKASE brings holder capture, calculation, approval, payment, and proof into one operator terminal.

3
00:00:11,082 --> 00:00:15,216
Our first user hypothesis is the corporate action operator.

4
00:00:15,216 --> 00:00:19,484
We support coupon payments, partial redemption, and maturity.

5
00:00:19,484 --> 00:00:25,278
The interface fixture is synthetic; financial evidence is disposable Localnet.

6
00:00:25,278 --> 00:00:30,641
A wallet authenticated API, PostgreSQL, and Solana support the terminal.

7
00:00:30,641 --> 00:00:36,710
Finalized capture fixes entitlements; full reserve and separate approval precede execution.

8
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:40,834
Each redemption payment and burn share one transaction.

9
00:00:40,834 --> 00:00:50,131
Our completed test pays seventeen hundred fifty KZT-Test in coupon, seven thousand for percentage redemption, and eight thousand for exact redemption.

10
00:00:50,131 --> 00:00:54,705
Maturity pays twenty one thousand and burns the remaining twenty bonds.

11
00:00:54,705 --> 00:00:57,439
Final supply is zero.

12
00:00:57,439 --> 00:01:00,758
Canonical receipt hashes are committed on-chain.

13
00:01:00,758 --> 00:01:06,771
Cash and token effects are reconciled; an unknown confirmation preserves the original signature.

14
00:01:06,771 --> 00:01:10,445
Evidence is reproducible from the repository.

15
00:01:10,445 --> 00:01:20,683
Founder Temirkhan Erbolatovich has two years of full-stack freelance experience, C# development experience at NIS, and a KazDream Holding internship.

16
00:01:20,683 --> 00:01:24,187
Adoption and willingness to pay are not established.

17
00:01:24,187 --> 00:01:29,825
Next, we will test completion, errors, and reconciliation time with operators.

18
00:01:29,825 --> 00:01:33,049
Pilot pricing is a hypothesis.

19
00:01:33,049 --> 00:01:36,519
We seek operator feedback and pilot partners.

20
00:01:36,519 --> 00:01:43,552
Public network acceptance, real KYC, fiat settlement, and exchange integration remain future work.

21
00:01:43,552 --> 00:01:55,000
LifecycleKASE is not affiliated with or approved by KASE.
